From 523b5838b8dc139308f4fddfc00e4fe924228bb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:38:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: support Bedrock Edition resource packs

Add the pack_edition global option (PackSquash #266). Packs with a
manifest.json and no pack.mcmeta are detected as Bedrock Edition packs.
The manifest is validated, and files are classified by Bedrock rules:
PNG textures, JSON files (comments allowed, key order kept) and Ogg Vorbis
audio are optimized, and every other file in a folder is copied as-is.
The alpha channel of textures is never altered, and only the pedantic ZIP
conformance level is accepted. Add a wiki page that documents the support.
